{"id": "71622", "title": "我的CP是死尸", "author": "腊月初五", "category": "都市言情", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71622.htm", "intro": "闲时打架，忙时哭灵，\n    这就是我陈多多的基本日常。\n    可是，哭灵被推进墓穴一口吻上死尸。\n    而死尸活过来，强烈要求和我组CP！\n    那帅的人神共愤的死尸，登堂入室，\n    不仅霸占我的房，还强行霸占我的床！\n    一系列诡异的事情，接连不断，\n    像大姨妈一样汹涌而来！\n    一人一尸组成了奇妙的CP，\n    让我的人生注定将惊悚进行到底！", "base": "files/article/html/71/71622", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001 被尸体拉进棺材", "file": "11228126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 不速之客", "file": "11228127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 十万的哭灵费", "file": "11228128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004 被一把推倒", "file": "11228129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 吻上了一具死尸", "file": "11228130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 干瘪的尸体突然变得饱满", "file": "11228131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 突然出现的脸", "file": "11228132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 我会替你照顾外婆", "file": "11228133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 那只递来浴巾的手", "file": "11228134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 血液在马桶中翻滚", "file": "11228135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 趴开人皮", "file": "11228136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 拽掉自己的脑袋", "file": "11228137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 告诉我，我是谁？！", "file": "11228138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 死尸食我阳气而复活？", "file": "11228139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015 被窝里冰冷的身体", "file": "11228140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 男尸居然不怕阳光", "file": "11228141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 只有白眼仁的古怪婴儿", "file": "11228142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 红色凉鞋", "file": "11228143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019 没有身子的双腿", "file": "11228144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020 李小宝女友死了", "file": "11228145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021 不许拿掉脑袋", "file": "11228146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "022 替他见女友最后一面", "file"